======================================================================
TOOL 1: FIBONACCI PRIMALITY WITNESS
======================================================================

Theory: For prime p != 2,5: p | F_{p - (p/5)}
  where (p/5) is +1 if p = 1,4 mod 5, else -1.

Numbers 2..10000:
  Actual primes:      1229
  Fib-PRP positives:  1238
  False positives (Fibonacci pseudoprimes): 9
  First 20 Fibonacci pseudoprimes: [323, 377, 1891, 3827, 4181, 5777, 6601, 6721, 8149]
  False negatives:    0

Speed (2..10000):
  Fibonacci PRP test: 0.0132 sec
  Trial division:     0.0019 sec
  Ratio (Fib/Trial):  6.92x

Large number test (n = 10^15 + 37, which is prime):
  Fib PRP: True in 0.000031 sec
  Trial:   True in 0.478081 sec
  Speedup: 15307.0x


